<Slide notes={`地址树从 World 的青禾社区开始，Sector 是学习中心，下面四个 Arena，公共大厅再挂公告栏和服务台两个对象。

选中任何一个节点，右侧就能填三样东西：节点名称、空间范围和空间语义。空间范围是 X、Y、W、H，以格为单位。

还有一个容易踩的坑：公告栏 board、服务台 helpdesk 是业务设计里的短名，用于教材对照；编辑器新建节点时产生的是自己的稳定节点 ID，不能假定两者自动相等。正确做法是在配置记录里建立对应关系。对象 Skill 的详细内容见 3.4 节，本节先保证对象的位置、外观和地址正确。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.3.3　建立四层地址树</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>地址树：逐层用「＋」创建</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 500, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>

            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>世界 · 四层地址树（示意）</Text>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 464, height: 52, background: '#276FBF', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 16px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>World　青禾社区</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>＋</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, marginLeft: 40 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 424, height: 52, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 16px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>Sector　学习中心</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>＋</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, marginLeft: 80 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 376, height: 44, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 16px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>Arena　阅读室</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 8 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>＋</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, marginLeft: 80 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 376, height: 44, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 16px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>Arena　手作室</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 8 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>＋</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, marginLeft: 80 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 376, height: 44, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 16px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>Arena　交流室</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 8 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>＋</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, marginLeft: 80 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 376, height: 44, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 16px' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>Arena　公共大厅</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 28, height: 28, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 8 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>＋</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, marginLeft: 120 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 172, height: 44, background: '#26816B', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>公告栏 board</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 172, height: 44, background: '#26816B', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>服务台 helpdesk</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779', width: 500, lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 4 }}>「＋」在父节点旁，逐层创建子节点；World 下建 Sector，Sector 下建 Arena，Arena 下建 Game Object，不跳层级。</Text>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 620, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>

            <Box style={{ background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>选中节点后，右侧可填</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 104, height: 34, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#276FBF' }}>节点名称</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B' }}>如「阅读室」「公共大厅」</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 104, height: 34, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#276FBF' }}>空间范围</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B' }}>X／Y／W／H，以格为单位</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 104, height: 34, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#276FBF' }}>空间语义</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B' }}>这个场所适合做什么、连接什么</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ background: '#F7F3E8', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>业务标识与节点 ID</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>公告栏 board、服务台 helpdesk 是业务设计标识，用于教材对照；编辑器新建节点时产生自己的稳定节点 ID，不能假定它自动等于短名，应在配置记录中建立对应关系。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 36, background: '#276FBF' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>对象 Skill 的详细内容见 3.4 节；本节先保证对象位置、外观和地址正确。</Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>3.3 从图像到四层空间</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>12 / 25</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
